    {
      "id": "claim_d82f88f3daa04efeacd6ef5092f8d56e",
      "statement": "Every agent/reviewer run trigger (Slack, Linear, GitHub, dashboard, scheduler) routes through a single durable dispatch contract, openswe/dispatch.py:dispatch_agent_run, which selects the graph via assistant_id ('agent' or 'reviewer') and treats source as metadata/logging only.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/dispatch.py#L429-L480",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e6fe0dfb7c1528cc05b8ed54e5dd04c7762fb3ec462e191d59f6bfed729b3e44:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_45387ab772f3437e9c3a2030f69732d5",
      "statement": "The dispatch contract defaults to multitask_strategy='interrupt' (a follow-up halts and resumes the active run with full history plus the new message), durability='async' checkpointing before each step written while the next step runs, stream_resumable=False so the dashboard reads thread history from its transcript database, and v3 protocol markers so the dashboard can attach to and observe runs it did not itself start.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://openswe/dispatch.py#L1-L25",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4a9bd84c0392c07c18c12c370c6d79b452ecadb44654a1bface6e858d493f5f4:"
